flowchart TD
    accTitle: Device resource dependency graph
    accDescr: Resource use links recorded commands. The graph orders those operations, groups barriers, and records driver commands; semantic scene stage selection occurs above it.
    Upload[Buffer or texture upload] -->|resource write| Draw[Draw list]
    Draw -->|attachment write then texture read| Compute[Compute list]
    Draw -->|resource usage| Callback[Native driver callback]
    Compute --> Sort[Dependency levels and allowed reordering]
    Callback --> Sort
    Sort --> Barriers[Barrier grouping and pass creation]
    Barriers --> Record[Native command recording]
    Record --> Submit[RD queue submission]
